{"key":"press-enter-ep02","seriesId":"press-enter","episode":"ep02","title":"How Did the Model Learn to Talk?","fps":30,"duration":293.938,"durationInFrames":8818,"video":{"width":1920,"height":1080,"burnCaptions":true,"brand":"learnvi.in"},"badge":["STOP 02","LIBRARY TOWN"],"series":{"title":"What Happens When You Press Enter?","subtitle":"How ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini Really Work","runningPrompt":"Write a short poem about the rain","stops":[{"id":"ep01","number":1,"name":"Departure Gate","stamp":"DEPARTURE GATE","topic":"The whole journey"},{"id":"ep02","number":2,"name":"Library Town","stamp":"LIBRARY TOWN","topic":"Training"},{"id":"ep03","number":3,"name":"Token City","stamp":"TOKEN CITY","topic":"Tokenization"},{"id":"ep04","number":4,"name":"Vector Valley","stamp":"VECTOR VALLEY","topic":"Embeddings"},{"id":"ep05","number":5,"name":"Attention Junction","stamp":"ATTENTION JUNCTION","topic":"Attention"},{"id":"ep06","number":6,"name":"Prediction Station","stamp":"PREDICTION STATION","topic":"Next-token prediction"},{"id":"ep07","number":7,"name":"Arrivals Hall","stamp":"ARRIVALS HALL","topic":"Beyond the model"}]},"stop":{"number":2,"name":"Library Town","stamp":"LIBRARY TOWN"},"shorts":{"width":1080,"height":1920,"maxSeconds":60,"cta":"Full episode: What Happens When You Press Enter? · Stop 2"},"thumbnail":{"headline":"How AI learned to talk","big":"read · practise · feedback"},"segments":[{"id":"passport","kind":"passport","component":"PassportStamp","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c01","start":0.6,"end":3.755,"marks":{"stamp":3.2},"text":"Next stop: Library Town! Passport out. Stamped.","words":[{"w":"Next","start":0.6},{"w":"stop:","start":0.96},{"w":"Library","start":1.32},{"w":"Town!","start":1.88},{"w":"Passport","start":2.32},{"w":"out.","start":2.92},{"w":"Stamped.","start":3.2}]},{"id":"c02","start":4.155,"end":12.187,"marks":{},"text":"This is stop number 2 of seven. Last time we followed our prompt all the way to an answer. Today we ask where the model came from.","words":[{"w":"This","start":4.155},{"w":"is","start":4.395},{"w":"stop","start":4.715},{"w":"number","start":5.035},{"w":"2","start":5.355},{"w":"of","start":5.595},{"w":"seven.","start":5.755},{"w":"Last","start":6.315},{"w":"time","start":6.715},{"w":"we","start":6.995},{"w":"followed","start":7.235},{"w":"our","start":7.635},{"w":"prompt","start":7.795},{"w":"all","start":8.195},{"w":"the","start":8.355},{"w":"way","start":8.475},{"w":"to","start":8.675},{"w":"an","start":8.835},{"w":"answer.","start":8.995},{"w":"Today","start":9.635},{"w":"we","start":10.275},{"w":"ask","start":10.555},{"w":"where","start":10.875},{"w":"the","start":11.075},{"w":"model","start":11.195},{"w":"came","start":11.635},{"w":"from.","start":11.915}]}],"title":"Next stop: Library Town","shortTitle":"Next stop: Library Town","props":{"stop":"Library Town","stamp":"LIBRARY TOWN","number":"2","stampAt":"c01@stamp"},"start":0.6,"end":12.187,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":393},{"id":"hook","kind":"hook","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":13.1,"end":19.687,"marks":{},"text":"Before it could answer you, the model read a huge share of the public internet: books, articles, websites, code.","words":[{"w":"Before","start":13.1},{"w":"it","start":13.34},{"w":"could","start":13.5},{"w":"answer","start":13.7},{"w":"you,","start":13.98},{"w":"the","start":14.22},{"w":"model","start":14.42},{"w":"read","start":14.82},{"w":"a","start":15.02},{"w":"huge","start":15.18},{"w":"share","start":15.5},{"w":"of","start":15.82},{"w":"the","start":15.9},{"w":"public","start":16.02},{"w":"internet:","start":16.42},{"w":"books,","start":17.22},{"w":"articles,","start":17.86},{"w":"websites,","start":18.54},{"w":"code.","start":19.3}]},{"id":"c04","start":20.087,"end":28.587,"marks":{},"text":"But here's the twist. All that reading only turned it into a strange autocomplete, not a helpful assistant. Let's see how it went to school.","words":[{"w":"But","start":20.087},{"w":"here's","start":20.247},{"w":"the","start":20.607},{"w":"twist.","start":20.767},{"w":"All","start":21.367},{"w":"that","start":21.687},{"w":"reading","start":21.927},{"w":"only","start":22.487},{"w":"turned","start":22.767},{"w":"it","start":23.087},{"w":"into","start":23.287},{"w":"a","start":23.487},{"w":"strange","start":23.607},{"w":"autocomplete,","start":24.367},{"w":"not","start":25.127},{"w":"a","start":25.367},{"w":"helpful","start":25.527},{"w":"assistant.","start":26.007},{"w":"Let's","start":26.847},{"w":"see","start":27.247},{"w":"how","start":27.447},{"w":"it","start":27.687},{"w":"went","start":27.847},{"w":"to","start":28.007},{"w":"school.","start":28.167}]}],"title":"A strange autocomplete","shortTitle":"A strange autocomplete","props":{"kicker":"Episode 2","text":"Reading the internet made it a strange autocomplete, not a helpful assistant.","highlight":["strange","autocomplete,"]},"start":13.1,"end":28.587,"startFrame":393,"durationInFrames":492},{"id":"route","kind":"routeMap","component":"RouteMap","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c05","start":29.5,"end":35.364,"marks":{"here":32.46},"text":"On the route map, we've left the Departure Gate, and we're here, in Library Town, where the model was trained.","words":[{"w":"On","start":29.5},{"w":"the","start":29.62},{"w":"route","start":29.74},{"w":"map,","start":30.1},{"w":"we've","start":30.42},{"w":"left","start":30.78},{"w":"the","start":30.98},{"w":"Departure","start":31.1},{"w":"Gate,","start":31.66},{"w":"and","start":32.06},{"w":"we're","start":32.22},{"w":"here,","start":32.46},{"w":"in","start":32.78},{"w":"Library","start":32.98},{"w":"Town,","start":33.54},{"w":"where","start":33.98},{"w":"the","start":34.14},{"w":"model","start":34.3},{"w":"was","start":34.66},{"w":"trained.","start":34.86}]}],"title":"Route map","shortTitle":"Route map","props":{"current":"ep02","highlightAt":"c05@here"},"start":29.5,"end":35.364,"startFrame":885,"durationInFrames":203},{"id":"school","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c06","start":36.267,"end":39.076,"marks":{},"text":"Think of the model's training as three stages of school.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":36.267},{"w":"of","start":36.427},{"w":"the","start":36.547},{"w":"model's","start":36.627},{"w":"training","start":37.107},{"w":"as","start":37.547},{"w":"three","start":37.787},{"w":"stages","start":38.027},{"w":"of","start":38.547},{"w":"school.","start":38.707}]},{"id":"c07","start":39.476,"end":44.548,"marks":{},"text":"Reading: first, it reads an enormous amount of text. This is called pre-training.","words":[{"w":"Reading:","start":39.476},{"w":"first,","start":40.116},{"w":"it","start":40.436},{"w":"reads","start":40.716},{"w":"an","start":41.076},{"w":"enormous","start":41.236},{"w":"amount","start":41.716},{"w":"of","start":42.076},{"w":"text.","start":42.196},{"w":"This","start":42.796},{"w":"is","start":43.076},{"w":"called","start":43.316},{"w":"pre-training.","start":43.756}]},{"id":"c08","start":44.948,"end":51.686,"marks":{},"text":"Practice: then it practises answering instructions, from worked examples. This is called instruction tuning.","words":[{"w":"Practice:","start":44.948},{"w":"then","start":45.588},{"w":"it","start":45.828},{"w":"practises","start":45.988},{"w":"answering","start":46.628},{"w":"instructions,","start":47.108},{"w":"from","start":47.988},{"w":"worked","start":48.188},{"w":"examples.","start":48.588},{"w":"This","start":49.508},{"w":"is","start":49.748},{"w":"called","start":50.028},{"w":"instruction","start":50.468},{"w":"tuning.","start":51.148}]},{"id":"c09","start":52.086,"end":56.464,"marks":{},"text":"Feedback: finally, it learns which of its answers people actually prefer.","words":[{"w":"Feedback:","start":52.426},{"w":"finally,","start":52.766},{"w":"it","start":53.486},{"w":"learns","start":53.686},{"w":"which","start":54.126},{"w":"of","start":54.326},{"w":"its","start":54.406},{"w":"answers","start":54.646},{"w":"people","start":55.086},{"w":"actually","start":55.406},{"w":"prefer.","start":55.926}]}],"title":"Three stages of school","shortTitle":"Three stages of school","props":{"kicker":"The model's school","title":"Three stages of training","steps":[{"label":"Reading","detail":"pre-training on huge amounts of text"},{"label":"Practice","detail":"instruction tuning on worked examples"},{"label":"Feedback","detail":"learning which answers people prefer"}]},"start":36.267,"end":56.464,"startFrame":1088,"durationInFrames":633},{"id":"pretrain","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c10","start":57.367,"end":66.029,"marks":{},"text":"Stage one, reading. Pre-training means reading a huge amount of text while playing just one game, over and over: predict the next word.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":57.367},{"w":"one,","start":57.927},{"w":"reading.","start":58.327},{"w":"Pre-training","start":59.207},{"w":"means","start":60.007},{"w":"reading","start":60.327},{"w":"a","start":60.647},{"w":"huge","start":60.807},{"w":"amount","start":61.087},{"w":"of","start":61.447},{"w":"text","start":61.567},{"w":"while","start":62.007},{"w":"playing","start":62.207},{"w":"just","start":62.607},{"w":"one","start":62.887},{"w":"game,","start":63.127},{"w":"over","start":63.647},{"w":"and","start":63.927},{"w":"over:","start":64.167},{"w":"predict","start":64.727},{"w":"the","start":65.207},{"w":"next","start":65.367},{"w":"word.","start":65.767}]},{"id":"c11","start":66.429,"end":76.643,"marks":{},"text":"Shown \"The capital of France is\", it learns to predict \"Paris\". Repeat that across trillions of words, and it picks up grammar, facts, and styles of writing along the way.","words":[{"w":"Shown","start":66.429},{"w":"\"The","start":66.749},{"w":"capital","start":66.909},{"w":"of","start":67.349},{"w":"France","start":67.469},{"w":"is\",","start":67.869},{"w":"it","start":68.229},{"w":"learns","start":68.509},{"w":"to","start":68.909},{"w":"predict","start":69.069},{"w":"\"Paris\".","start":69.629},{"w":"Repeat","start":70.389},{"w":"that","start":70.909},{"w":"across","start":71.149},{"w":"trillions","start":71.589},{"w":"of","start":72.149},{"w":"words,","start":72.269},{"w":"and","start":72.709},{"w":"it","start":72.909},{"w":"picks","start":73.069},{"w":"up","start":73.389},{"w":"grammar,","start":73.589},{"w":"facts,","start":74.149},{"w":"and","start":74.629},{"w":"styles","start":74.789},{"w":"of","start":75.269},{"w":"writing","start":75.469},{"w":"along","start":75.869},{"w":"the","start":76.229},{"w":"way.","start":76.389}]},{"id":"c12","start":77.043,"end":80.96,"marks":{},"text":"Think of a student who reads every book in the library, cover to cover.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":77.043},{"w":"of","start":77.203},{"w":"a","start":77.323},{"w":"student","start":77.443},{"w":"who","start":77.883},{"w":"reads","start":78.003},{"w":"every","start":78.403},{"w":"book","start":78.683},{"w":"in","start":78.923},{"w":"the","start":79.043},{"w":"library,","start":79.203},{"w":"cover","start":79.923},{"w":"to","start":80.323},{"w":"cover.","start":80.523}]}],"title":"Pre-training","shortTitle":"Pre-training","props":{"kicker":"Stage 1 · Reading","term":"Pre-training","definition":"Reading a huge amount of text while playing one game, over and over: predict the next word.","example":"The capital of France is … → Paris","analogy":"A student who reads every book in the library."},"start":57.367,"end":80.96,"startFrame":1721,"durationInFrames":735},{"id":"stores","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c13","start":81.867,"end":85.847,"marks":{},"text":"So what does the model keep from all that reading? Not what you might expect.","words":[{"w":"So","start":81.867},{"w":"what","start":82.107},{"w":"does","start":82.267},{"w":"the","start":82.467},{"w":"model","start":82.587},{"w":"keep","start":83.067},{"w":"from","start":83.307},{"w":"all","start":83.467},{"w":"that","start":83.667},{"w":"reading?","start":83.867},{"w":"Not","start":84.427},{"w":"what","start":84.667},{"w":"you","start":84.907},{"w":"might","start":85.067},{"w":"expect.","start":85.267}]},{"id":"c14","start":86.247,"end":93.491,"marks":{},"text":"It doesn't keep a copy of the internet. There's no folder of saved web pages, and it can't look up a page it once read.","words":[{"w":"It","start":86.247},{"w":"doesn't","start":86.367},{"w":"keep","start":86.727},{"w":"a","start":86.887},{"w":"copy","start":87.047},{"w":"of","start":87.447},{"w":"the","start":87.527},{"w":"internet.","start":87.687},{"w":"There's","start":88.447},{"w":"no","start":88.887},{"w":"folder","start":89.167},{"w":"of","start":89.767},{"w":"saved","start":89.927},{"w":"web","start":90.367},{"w":"pages,","start":90.687},{"w":"and","start":91.247},{"w":"it","start":91.447},{"w":"can't","start":91.647},{"w":"look","start":91.927},{"w":"up","start":92.127},{"w":"a","start":92.287},{"w":"page","start":92.407},{"w":"it","start":92.647},{"w":"once","start":92.847},{"w":"read.","start":93.127}]},{"id":"c15","start":93.891,"end":107.686,"marks":{},"text":"Instead, it keeps patterns, stored in billions of numbers called parameters, which were adjusted a tiny bit with every prediction. Patterns of grammar, facts, styles, and ways of reasoning. Patterns, not pages.","words":[{"w":"Instead,","start":93.891},{"w":"it","start":94.451},{"w":"keeps","start":94.651},{"w":"patterns,","start":95.011},{"w":"stored","start":95.731},{"w":"in","start":96.131},{"w":"billions","start":96.291},{"w":"of","start":96.638},{"w":"numbers","start":96.984},{"w":"called","start":97.331},{"w":"parameters,","start":97.651},{"w":"which","start":98.451},{"w":"were","start":98.651},{"w":"adjusted","start":98.771},{"w":"a","start":99.331},{"w":"tiny","start":99.491},{"w":"bit","start":99.891},{"w":"with","start":100.171},{"w":"every","start":100.411},{"w":"prediction.","start":100.691},{"w":"Patterns","start":101.611},{"w":"of","start":102.331},{"w":"grammar,","start":102.531},{"w":"facts,","start":103.131},{"w":"styles,","start":103.731},{"w":"and","start":104.331},{"w":"ways","start":104.531},{"w":"of","start":104.811},{"w":"reasoning.","start":104.971},{"w":"Patterns,","start":105.811},{"w":"not","start":106.691},{"w":"pages.","start":106.931}]}],"title":"What the model keeps","shortTitle":"What the model keeps","props":{"kicker":"What it keeps","title":"Patterns, not pages","columns":[{"title":"Not a copy","items":["no saved web pages","can't look up what it read"],"tone":"bad"},{"title":"Patterns","items":["billions of numbers, tuned while reading","grammar, facts, styles, ways of reasoning"],"tone":"good"}],"verdict":{"text":"Patterns, not pages"}},"start":81.867,"end":107.686,"startFrame":2456,"durationInFrames":802},{"id":"base","kind":"core","component":"Chat","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c16","start":108.6,"end":117.569,"marks":{},"text":"Here's what that strange autocomplete looks like. A model straight out of pre-training is called a base model. Watch what happens when you ask it a question.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":108.78},{"w":"what","start":108.96},{"w":"that","start":109.16},{"w":"strange","start":109.4},{"w":"autocomplete","start":110.1},{"w":"looks","start":110.8},{"w":"like.","start":111.12},{"w":"A","start":111.52},{"w":"model","start":111.72},{"w":"straight","start":112.2},{"w":"out","start":112.64},{"w":"of","start":112.76},{"w":"pre-training","start":112.88},{"w":"is","start":113.56},{"w":"called","start":113.72},{"w":"a","start":114.04},{"w":"base","start":114.16},{"w":"model.","start":114.48},{"w":"Watch","start":115.16},{"w":"what","start":115.56},{"w":"happens","start":115.8},{"w":"when","start":116.24},{"w":"you","start":116.4},{"w":"ask","start":116.56},{"w":"it","start":116.8},{"w":"a","start":116.86},{"w":"question.","start":116.92}]},{"id":"c17","start":117.969,"end":120.257,"marks":{},"text":"You type: \"What is the capital of France?\"","words":[{"w":"You","start":117.969},{"w":"type:","start":118.209},{"w":"\"What","start":118.689},{"w":"is","start":118.889},{"w":"the","start":119.049},{"w":"capital","start":119.169},{"w":"of","start":119.609},{"w":"France?\"","start":119.769}]},{"id":"c18","start":120.657,"end":131.809,"marks":{},"text":"And it might reply: \"What is the capital of Germany? What is the capital of Italy?\" It isn't being rude. It's continuing the text, the way a list of quiz questions continues online.","words":[{"w":"And","start":120.657},{"w":"it","start":120.817},{"w":"might","start":120.977},{"w":"reply:","start":121.257},{"w":"\"What","start":121.857},{"w":"is","start":122.097},{"w":"the","start":122.257},{"w":"capital","start":122.417},{"w":"of","start":122.857},{"w":"Germany?","start":123.017},{"w":"What","start":123.617},{"w":"is","start":123.817},{"w":"the","start":123.977},{"w":"capital","start":124.137},{"w":"of","start":124.657},{"w":"Italy?\"","start":124.817},{"w":"It","start":125.457},{"w":"isn't","start":125.777},{"w":"being","start":126.177},{"w":"rude.","start":126.497},{"w":"It's","start":127.017},{"w":"continuing","start":127.377},{"w":"the","start":128.017},{"w":"text,","start":128.177},{"w":"the","start":128.657},{"w":"way","start":128.817},{"w":"a","start":129.017},{"w":"list","start":129.177},{"w":"of","start":129.527},{"w":"quiz","start":129.877},{"w":"questions","start":130.227},{"w":"continues","start":130.577},{"w":"online.","start":131.193}]}],"title":"A base model's answer","shortTitle":"Why raw AI answers questions with more questions","props":{"kicker":"Before practice","title":"A base model just continues the text","messages":[{"role":"user","text":"What is the capital of France?"},{"role":"ai","text":"What is the capital of Germany? What is the capital of Italy? What is the capital of Spain?"}]},"start":108.6,"end":131.809,"startFrame":3258,"durationInFrames":724},{"id":"instruct","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c19","start":132.733,"end":143.625,"marks":{},"text":"Stage two, practice. Instruction tuning means more training on many examples of instructions paired with good answers, so the model learns to respond like an assistant.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":132.733},{"w":"two,","start":133.253},{"w":"practice.","start":133.613},{"w":"Instruction","start":134.613},{"w":"tuning","start":135.373},{"w":"means","start":135.973},{"w":"more","start":136.333},{"w":"training","start":136.573},{"w":"on","start":137.053},{"w":"many","start":137.293},{"w":"examples","start":137.613},{"w":"of","start":138.173},{"w":"instructions","start":138.333},{"w":"paired","start":139.133},{"w":"with","start":139.533},{"w":"good","start":139.733},{"w":"answers,","start":140.053},{"w":"so","start":140.693},{"w":"the","start":140.893},{"w":"model","start":141.093},{"w":"learns","start":141.533},{"w":"to","start":141.933},{"w":"respond","start":142.053},{"w":"like","start":142.653},{"w":"an","start":142.853},{"w":"assistant.","start":143.013}]},{"id":"c20","start":144.025,"end":153.032,"marks":{},"text":"For example: \"Summarise this article\", followed by a clear, short summary. Thousands of examples like that teach it the shape of a helpful reply.","words":[{"w":"For","start":144.025},{"w":"example:","start":144.225},{"w":"\"Summarise","start":144.985},{"w":"this","start":145.705},{"w":"article\",","start":145.945},{"w":"followed","start":146.665},{"w":"by","start":147.065},{"w":"a","start":147.265},{"w":"clear,","start":147.425},{"w":"short","start":147.905},{"w":"summary.","start":148.305},{"w":"Thousands","start":149.105},{"w":"of","start":149.705},{"w":"examples","start":149.865},{"w":"like","start":150.465},{"w":"that","start":150.665},{"w":"teach","start":150.865},{"w":"it","start":151.145},{"w":"the","start":151.265},{"w":"shape","start":151.385},{"w":"of","start":151.705},{"w":"a","start":151.785},{"w":"helpful","start":151.945},{"w":"reply.","start":152.465}]},{"id":"c21","start":153.432,"end":157.875,"marks":{},"text":"It's like practising past exam papers, with model answers to learn from.","words":[{"w":"It's","start":153.432},{"w":"like","start":153.632},{"w":"practising","start":153.832},{"w":"past","start":154.472},{"w":"exam","start":154.965},{"w":"papers,","start":155.459},{"w":"with","start":155.952},{"w":"model","start":156.192},{"w":"answers","start":156.672},{"w":"to","start":157.112},{"w":"learn","start":157.272},{"w":"from.","start":157.592}]}],"title":"Instruction tuning","shortTitle":"Instruction tuning","props":{"kicker":"Stage 2 · Practice","term":"Instruction tuning","definition":"More training on many examples of instructions paired with good answers, so the model learns to respond like an assistant.","example":"“Summarise this…” → a clear, short summary","analogy":"Practising past exam papers, with model answers to copy."},"start":132.733,"end":157.875,"startFrame":3982,"durationInFrames":782},{"id":"feedback","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c22","start":158.8,"end":166.425,"marks":{},"text":"Stage three, feedback. Often called reinforcement learning from human feedback, or RLHF. It works like this.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":158.8},{"w":"three,","start":159.32},{"w":"feedback.","start":159.94},{"w":"Often","start":160.56},{"w":"called","start":161},{"w":"reinforcement","start":161.36},{"w":"learning","start":162.12},{"w":"from","start":162.48},{"w":"human","start":162.64},{"w":"feedback,","start":163.24},{"w":"or","start":163.84},{"w":"RLHF.","start":164.44},{"w":"It","start":165.04},{"w":"works","start":165.44},{"w":"like","start":165.84},{"w":"this.","start":166.12}]},{"id":"c23","start":166.825,"end":170.621,"marks":{},"text":"Generate: the model writes two different answers to the same prompt.","words":[{"w":"Generate:","start":166.825},{"w":"the","start":167.545},{"w":"model","start":167.785},{"w":"writes","start":168.185},{"w":"two","start":168.545},{"w":"different","start":168.745},{"w":"answers","start":169.185},{"w":"to","start":169.545},{"w":"the","start":169.705},{"w":"same","start":169.865},{"w":"prompt.","start":170.105}]},{"id":"c24","start":171.021,"end":173.924,"marks":{},"text":"Compare: people look at both, and pick the better one.","words":[{"w":"Compare:","start":171.021},{"w":"people","start":171.741},{"w":"look","start":172.101},{"w":"at","start":172.301},{"w":"both,","start":172.461},{"w":"and","start":172.781},{"w":"pick","start":172.941},{"w":"the","start":173.181},{"w":"better","start":173.341},{"w":"one.","start":173.661}]},{"id":"c25","start":174.324,"end":179.656,"marks":{},"text":"Learn: from many of those choices, a separate scoring model learns what people tend to prefer.","words":[{"w":"Learn:","start":174.324},{"w":"from","start":174.764},{"w":"many","start":175.004},{"w":"of","start":175.284},{"w":"those","start":175.444},{"w":"choices,","start":175.724},{"w":"a","start":176.404},{"w":"separate","start":176.644},{"w":"scoring","start":177.124},{"w":"model","start":177.524},{"w":"learns","start":177.884},{"w":"what","start":178.244},{"w":"people","start":178.484},{"w":"tend","start":178.764},{"w":"to","start":179.044},{"w":"prefer.","start":179.164}]},{"id":"c26","start":180.056,"end":187.857,"marks":{},"text":"Improve: the main model is then tuned to write answers that score higher. That's where much of its politeness and helpfulness comes from.","words":[{"w":"Improve:","start":180.056},{"w":"the","start":180.696},{"w":"main","start":180.856},{"w":"model","start":181.176},{"w":"is","start":181.616},{"w":"then","start":181.776},{"w":"tuned","start":181.976},{"w":"to","start":182.336},{"w":"write","start":182.536},{"w":"answers","start":182.816},{"w":"that","start":183.336},{"w":"score","start":183.576},{"w":"higher.","start":184.056},{"w":"That's","start":184.616},{"w":"where","start":185.056},{"w":"much","start":185.296},{"w":"of","start":185.496},{"w":"its","start":185.576},{"w":"politeness","start":185.816},{"w":"and","start":186.416},{"w":"helpfulness","start":186.616},{"w":"comes","start":187.296},{"w":"from.","start":187.616}]}],"title":"Learning from feedback","shortTitle":"Learning from feedback","props":{"kicker":"Stage 3 · Feedback","title":"Learning which answers people prefer","steps":[{"label":"Generate","detail":"two answers to the same prompt"},{"label":"Compare","detail":"people pick the better one"},{"label":"Learn","detail":"a scorer learns their taste"},{"label":"Improve","detail":"the model aims for higher scores"}]},"start":158.8,"end":187.857,"startFrame":4764,"durationInFrames":899},{"id":"cutoff","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c27","start":188.767,"end":193.429,"marks":{},"text":"There's one catch to all this schooling, and it explains a lot of confusing answers.","words":[{"w":"There's","start":188.767},{"w":"one","start":189.047},{"w":"catch","start":189.287},{"w":"to","start":189.647},{"w":"all","start":189.807},{"w":"this","start":189.967},{"w":"schooling,","start":190.127},{"w":"and","start":190.727},{"w":"it","start":190.967},{"w":"explains","start":191.167},{"w":"a","start":191.727},{"w":"lot","start":191.887},{"w":"of","start":192.047},{"w":"confusing","start":192.207},{"w":"answers.","start":192.847}]},{"id":"c28","start":193.829,"end":197.697,"marks":{},"text":"The model's reading stops at a certain date, called its knowledge cutoff.","words":[{"w":"The","start":193.829},{"w":"model's","start":193.949},{"w":"reading","start":194.389},{"w":"stops","start":194.789},{"w":"at","start":195.189},{"w":"a","start":195.309},{"w":"certain","start":195.429},{"w":"date,","start":195.709},{"w":"called","start":196.069},{"w":"its","start":196.429},{"w":"knowledge","start":196.709},{"w":"cutoff.","start":197.203}]},{"id":"c29","start":198.097,"end":203.089,"marks":{},"text":"Anything that happened after that was never in its library, so it simply doesn't know about it.","words":[{"w":"Anything","start":198.097},{"w":"that","start":198.497},{"w":"happened","start":198.697},{"w":"after","start":199.177},{"w":"that","start":199.497},{"w":"was","start":199.697},{"w":"never","start":199.937},{"w":"in","start":200.217},{"w":"its","start":200.337},{"w":"library,","start":200.617},{"w":"so","start":201.217},{"w":"it","start":201.457},{"w":"simply","start":201.617},{"w":"doesn't","start":201.977},{"w":"know","start":202.337},{"w":"about","start":202.617},{"w":"it.","start":202.857}]},{"id":"c30","start":203.489,"end":208.345,"marks":{},"text":"Unless the app around it adds a web search, and passes the results in with your question.","words":[{"w":"Unless","start":203.489},{"w":"the","start":203.849},{"w":"app","start":204.069},{"w":"around","start":204.289},{"w":"it","start":204.609},{"w":"adds","start":204.769},{"w":"a","start":205.089},{"w":"web","start":205.209},{"w":"search,","start":205.489},{"w":"and","start":205.969},{"w":"passes","start":206.209},{"w":"the","start":206.649},{"w":"results","start":206.809},{"w":"in","start":207.329},{"w":"with","start":207.489},{"w":"your","start":207.774},{"w":"question.","start":208.06}]}],"title":"The knowledge cutoff","shortTitle":"The knowledge cutoff","props":{"kicker":"A catch","title":"Why it doesn't know yesterday's news","items":[{"text":"Its reading stops at a cutoff date"},{"text":"Anything newer was never in its library"},{"text":"Unless the app adds a web search"}],"numbered":false},"start":188.767,"end":208.345,"startFrame":5663,"durationInFrames":615},{"id":"tryIt","kind":"tryIt","component":"TryIt","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c31","start":209.267,"end":211.823,"marks":{},"text":"Time for \"Try it yourself\". Grab your phone.","words":[{"w":"Time","start":209.267},{"w":"for","start":209.547},{"w":"\"Try","start":209.747},{"w":"it","start":210.027},{"w":"yourself\".","start":210.187},{"w":"Grab","start":210.827},{"w":"your","start":211.187},{"w":"phone.","start":211.347}]},{"id":"c32","start":212.223,"end":217.036,"marks":{},"text":"First, with web search turned off, ask a chatbot: \"What happened in the news last week?\"","words":[{"w":"First,","start":212.223},{"w":"with","start":212.583},{"w":"web","start":212.783},{"w":"search","start":213.103},{"w":"turned","start":213.503},{"w":"off,","start":213.743},{"w":"ask","start":214.023},{"w":"a","start":214.303},{"w":"chatbot:","start":214.723},{"w":"\"What","start":215.143},{"w":"happened","start":215.423},{"w":"in","start":215.823},{"w":"the","start":215.943},{"w":"news","start":216.063},{"w":"last","start":216.423},{"w":"week?\"","start":216.703}]},{"id":"c33","start":217.436,"end":225.75,"marks":{},"text":"Then turn search on, and ask again. Compare the two answers. Notice which one admits it doesn't know, and which one can actually tell you.","words":[{"w":"Then","start":217.436},{"w":"turn","start":217.716},{"w":"search","start":218.036},{"w":"on,","start":218.476},{"w":"and","start":218.716},{"w":"ask","start":218.996},{"w":"again.","start":219.356},{"w":"Compare","start":219.916},{"w":"the","start":220.396},{"w":"two","start":220.556},{"w":"answers.","start":220.876},{"w":"Notice","start":221.676},{"w":"which","start":222.236},{"w":"one","start":222.436},{"w":"admits","start":222.636},{"w":"it","start":223.116},{"w":"doesn't","start":223.236},{"w":"know,","start":223.636},{"w":"and","start":223.916},{"w":"which","start":224.116},{"w":"one","start":224.356},{"w":"can","start":224.556},{"w":"actually","start":224.756},{"w":"tell","start":225.276},{"w":"you.","start":225.476}]}],"title":"Try it yourself","shortTitle":"Try it yourself","props":{"steps":[{"text":"With web search off, ask: what happened in the news last week?","at":"c32"},{"text":"Turn search on and ask again. Compare the two answers.","at":"c33"}],"chat":"What happened in the news last week?"},"start":209.267,"end":235.75,"startFrame":6278,"durationInFrames":822},{"id":"myth","kind":"myth","component":"MythVsReality","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c34","start":236.667,"end":238.177,"marks":{},"text":"Myth versus reality.","words":[{"w":"Myth","start":236.96},{"w":"versus","start":237.254},{"w":"reality.","start":237.547}]},{"id":"c35","start":238.577,"end":241.827,"marks":{},"text":"The myth: the model learns from my chats in real time.","words":[{"w":"The","start":238.577},{"w":"myth:","start":238.737},{"w":"the","start":239.097},{"w":"model","start":239.297},{"w":"learns","start":239.697},{"w":"from","start":240.057},{"w":"my","start":240.217},{"w":"chats","start":240.377},{"w":"in","start":240.817},{"w":"real","start":241.017},{"w":"time.","start":241.457}]},{"id":"c36","start":242.227,"end":258.18,"marks":{"reality":242.387},"text":"The reality: its knowledge is fixed when training ends. Within a conversation it can use what you've said, like short-term memory, but that doesn't change the model itself. Whether conversations are used to train future versions depends on the app and your settings.","words":[{"w":"The","start":242.227},{"w":"reality:","start":242.387},{"w":"its","start":243.107},{"w":"knowledge","start":243.467},{"w":"is","start":243.947},{"w":"fixed","start":244.147},{"w":"when","start":244.547},{"w":"training","start":244.707},{"w":"ends.","start":245.227},{"w":"Within","start":245.867},{"w":"a","start":246.227},{"w":"conversation","start":246.347},{"w":"it","start":247.107},{"w":"can","start":247.307},{"w":"use","start":247.507},{"w":"what","start":247.787},{"w":"you've","start":247.947},{"w":"said,","start":248.267},{"w":"like","start":248.627},{"w":"short-term","start":249.087},{"w":"memory,","start":249.547},{"w":"but","start":250.147},{"w":"that","start":250.347},{"w":"doesn't","start":250.547},{"w":"change","start":251.027},{"w":"the","start":251.347},{"w":"model","start":251.507},{"w":"itself.","start":251.987},{"w":"Whether","start":252.787},{"w":"conversations","start":253.187},{"w":"are","start":254.027},{"w":"used","start":254.227},{"w":"to","start":254.467},{"w":"train","start":254.627},{"w":"future","start":255.134},{"w":"versions","start":255.64},{"w":"depends","start":256.147},{"w":"on","start":256.627},{"w":"the","start":256.707},{"w":"app","start":256.947},{"w":"and","start":257.187},{"w":"your","start":257.347},{"w":"settings.","start":257.587}]}],"title":"Myth vs reality: does it learn from my chats?","shortTitle":"Does AI learn from your chats in real time?","props":{"myth":"It learns from my chats in real time","reality":"Its knowledge is fixed after training. Your chat is only short-term memory for that conversation.","revealAt":"c36@reality"},"start":236.667,"end":258.18,"startFrame":7100,"durationInFrames":673},{"id":"useIt","kind":"useIt","component":"UseIt","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c37","start":259.1,"end":263.772,"marks":{},"text":"And here's your \"Use it tomorrow\" tip: don't trust recent facts unless search is on.","words":[{"w":"And","start":259.1},{"w":"here's","start":259.18},{"w":"your","start":259.5},{"w":"\"Use","start":259.7},{"w":"it","start":259.94},{"w":"tomorrow\"","start":260.22},{"w":"tip:","start":260.62},{"w":"don't","start":261.02},{"w":"trust","start":261.38},{"w":"recent","start":261.74},{"w":"facts","start":262.18},{"w":"unless","start":262.58},{"w":"search","start":262.94},{"w":"is","start":263.3},{"w":"on.","start":263.5}]},{"id":"c38","start":264.172,"end":274.245,"marks":{},"text":"If you're asking about anything recent, turn search on. Ask for sources and dates. And double-check anything that changes fast, like prices, laws, or the news.","words":[{"w":"If","start":264.172},{"w":"you're","start":264.292},{"w":"asking","start":264.492},{"w":"about","start":264.892},{"w":"anything","start":265.132},{"w":"recent,","start":265.492},{"w":"turn","start":266.132},{"w":"search","start":266.412},{"w":"on.","start":266.852},{"w":"Ask","start":267.292},{"w":"for","start":267.772},{"w":"sources","start":267.972},{"w":"and","start":268.572},{"w":"dates.","start":268.772},{"w":"And","start":269.292},{"w":"double-check","start":269.792},{"w":"anything","start":270.292},{"w":"that","start":270.652},{"w":"changes","start":270.892},{"w":"fast,","start":271.372},{"w":"like","start":271.852},{"w":"prices,","start":272.172},{"w":"laws,","start":272.892},{"w":"or","start":273.412},{"w":"the","start":273.612},{"w":"news.","start":273.812}]}],"title":"Use it tomorrow","shortTitle":"Use it tomorrow","props":{"tip":"Don't trust recent facts unless search is on","bullets":["Recent events? Turn search on","Ask for sources and dates","Double-check anything that changes fast"],"bulletsAt":"c38"},"start":259.1,"end":274.245,"startFrame":7773,"durationInFrames":482},{"id":"recap","kind":"recapNext","component":"RecapNext","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c39","start":275.167,"end":281.025,"marks":{},"text":"Let's stamp the passport. The model went to school in three stages: reading, practice, and feedback.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":275.167},{"w":"stamp","start":275.447},{"w":"the","start":275.767},{"w":"passport.","start":275.887},{"w":"The","start":276.487},{"w":"model","start":276.727},{"w":"went","start":277.127},{"w":"to","start":277.287},{"w":"school","start":277.407},{"w":"in","start":277.727},{"w":"three","start":277.927},{"w":"stages:","start":278.207},{"w":"reading,","start":279.007},{"w":"practice,","start":279.567},{"w":"and","start":280.167},{"w":"feedback.","start":280.596}]},{"id":"c40","start":281.425,"end":285.898,"marks":{},"text":"It stores patterns, not pages, and its knowledge stops at a cutoff date.","words":[{"w":"It","start":281.425},{"w":"stores","start":281.585},{"w":"patterns,","start":281.985},{"w":"not","start":282.705},{"w":"pages,","start":282.945},{"w":"and","start":283.625},{"w":"its","start":283.865},{"w":"knowledge","start":284.145},{"w":"stops","start":284.545},{"w":"at","start":284.865},{"w":"a","start":284.985},{"w":"cutoff","start":285.265},{"w":"date.","start":285.545}]},{"id":"c41","start":286.298,"end":292.438,"marks":{"question":287.778},"text":"Now let's go inside. Step one: how does the model even read your words? Next stop: Token City.","word